WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.293 --> 00:00:04.004
- [Adam Lefkoe:] Is Karl-Anthony Towns underrated?

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:07.841
Ooh. Gets it back.

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:10.844
Ahhh.
- [Karl-Anthony Towns:] Look at him.

00:00:11.302 --> 00:00:13.513
Look what I did to him with one move!
- Look what you did to that T-Rex.

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:14.472
- One move!

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:26.109
- Welcome to "Underrated,"
the only show that improves

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:29.362
the video game ratings of your favorite
professional athletes.

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:32.615
Today, that's Karl-Anthony Towns,
two-time All-Star.

00:00:33.116 --> 00:00:35.660
Let's go to our professional
2K gamer Davisss

00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:39.372
to see how he stacks up in the game.

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:43.001
- [ImDavisss:] Karl-Anthony Towns, the man's a superstar.

00:00:43.626 --> 00:00:47.047
Me personally, what I look
for is someone that can rebound strong,

00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:50.425
handle the rock just a little bit
and can definitely spread the floor

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:52.802
and hit the open passer
when the double-team comes in the post.

00:01:01.644 --> 00:01:03.605
- [Lefkoe:] I was looking at your rating.
- [Towns laughing]

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:07.025
- The one that stuck out to me
is your passing rating.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.819
I think you're a pretty good passer.
- I appreciate it.

00:01:09.944 --> 00:01:11.863
- I've seen it. I've seen—what are you,

00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:13.490
4.5 assists last year?
- Yeah.

00:01:13.531 --> 00:01:15.700
- I mean, you were like one below
D'Angelo Russell.

00:01:16.034 --> 00:01:17.702
What do you think
your passer rating was?

00:01:17.702 --> 00:01:20.497
Do you know this?
- As a big man, they always

00:01:20.497 --> 00:01:21.706
kind of put it down a little bit.
- Sure.

00:01:21.998 --> 00:01:25.502
- So I'll probably say, like, high 70s.
- High 70s.

00:01:25.502 --> 00:01:27.837
- Low 80s.
- What if I were to tell you, Karl-Anthony Towns,

00:01:27.837 --> 00:01:30.423
that it is 60?
- 60 what?

00:01:30.465 --> 00:01:33.510
Just a, nope, just a flat 60.
- What the f--k.

00:01:35.303 --> 00:01:36.054
Where's Ronnie?

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:40.016
- [Lefkoe:] This is the
wonderful, the illuminary,

00:01:40.308 --> 00:01:42.936
the prescient Ronnie 2K, everybody.

00:01:44.187 --> 00:01:45.480
- You got a problem with that passing rating?

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:46.523
Let's fix it.
- Man...let's go get it going.

00:01:47.148 --> 00:01:49.651
- Aight, you have my eyeballs.
- Yup.

00:01:49.651 --> 00:01:53.196
- Let's see if we can get passing up a little bit.
- We sat Ronnie and his beautiful brain in a room,

00:01:53.363 --> 00:01:55.115
and we came up with some drills.
- OK.

00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:57.033
- And so the first drill that we have

00:01:57.033 --> 00:02:00.286
is to improve that passer rating,
and I think we can improve it a bunch, too.

00:02:00.662 --> 00:02:01.704
- Yeah, we can get it up.

00:02:01.704 --> 00:02:06.126
- If he performs really poorly, though, could it also go down?
- Of course it could.

00:02:06.167 --> 00:02:08.211
- OK, sure.
- So if I throw it off the ceiling, for example—

00:02:08.211 --> 00:02:10.755
- Yeah. Or you like hit a camera guy
in the back of the head?

00:02:11.172 --> 00:02:12.465
- I think that we may get sued.

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:15.009
I think that could be worse
than the rating.

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:19.848
- [Lefkoe:] Let's challenge the assumption
that great insurance is only available

00:02:19.848 --> 00:02:23.726
at high rates, while KAT gets a chance
to challenge the assumption

00:02:23.935 --> 00:02:26.020
that a big man can't dish the ball.

00:02:34.195 --> 00:02:35.822
Here's how this is gonna work.
- [Towns:] OK.

00:02:35.822 --> 00:02:39.325
- I want you to drive the lane,
and I don't, I don't want you to take it easy.

00:02:39.701 --> 00:02:42.954
I want like a game-speed drive,
and then a kick-out,

00:02:43.413 --> 00:02:44.164
and we're gonna do it

00:02:44.164 --> 00:02:47.125
three times, and the target's
gonna get smaller each time.

00:02:48.126 --> 00:02:50.211
What are you looking for as he does this?

00:02:50.211 --> 00:02:52.589
- Look, I mean he—this is very important to him.

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:56.509
I expect precision.
- OK.

00:02:56.593 --> 00:02:59.053
If you really hate your 60 rating, now is the chance.
- OK.

00:02:59.095 --> 00:03:00.722
- Whenever you're ready.

00:03:05.435 --> 00:03:07.228
That was a good pass, though.
- It was a good pass.

00:03:07.228 --> 00:03:09.439
But this is where it really steps up.

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:14.694
- Ooooh! You see that? I didn't even hit

00:03:14.694 --> 00:03:18.198
any part of the white. The bullseye's
the only thing that got hit. Damn.

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:19.741
- [Lefkoe:] Whenever you're ready, Karl.
- [Towns:] All right.

00:03:20.909 --> 00:03:21.868
- [Ronnie 2K:] Here we go. Here we go.

00:03:23.119 --> 00:03:28.833
- [Lefkoe:] Oh! Drilled it. There
 wasn't a doubt in his mind. He's got the big smile.

00:03:28.833 --> 00:03:31.586
- [Ronnie:] He's just staring me down.
- I told you!

00:03:31.586 --> 00:03:35.131
- He's just staring at Ronnie right now.
- Yeah, that alone, this didn't move.

00:03:35.131 --> 00:03:36.633
- Are you intimidated at all?

00:03:36.633 --> 00:03:38.176
- I mean, he didn't even touch the pole.

00:03:38.176 --> 00:03:40.261
That was as clean as it gets.

00:03:43.306 --> 00:03:44.515
- Very impressed.
- Yeah.

00:03:44.515 --> 00:03:46.100
- Congratulations.
- Got a lot to think about.

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:47.727
- Gotta be honest, though,
we went back and talked about it.

00:03:47.727 --> 00:03:49.354
We need to see longer passes.

00:03:49.354 --> 00:03:50.855
So we're gonna do the opposite,

00:03:50.855 --> 00:03:52.565
which is instead of finishing a break,

00:03:52.565 --> 00:03:53.858
starting a break.
- OK.

00:03:53.858 --> 00:03:57.654
- We're gonna do some outlet passes down here,
all the way out here.

00:03:57.654 --> 00:03:59.364
- OK.
- Let's see what you got.

00:04:00.531 --> 00:04:04.744
All right, Karl. Outlet passes.
3, 2, 1.

00:04:13.419 --> 00:04:15.630
Ooh! Is that considered a hit?
- [Ronnie:] That was pretty close.

00:04:15.672 --> 00:04:16.714
- [Lefkoe:] I mean…
- You said hit it.

00:04:16.714 --> 00:04:18.341
- [Lefkoe:] He did hit it.
- [Ronnie] That was pretty close.

00:04:18.633 --> 00:04:22.303
- I mean, the man baseball-passed it.
Randy Johnsoned the ball right there.

00:04:22.595 --> 00:04:26.683
Now it is time for
basketball-on-basketball crime.

00:04:32.146 --> 00:04:35.525
Oh! Shattered.

00:04:35.525 --> 00:04:39.028
- Fatality.
- [Lefkoe making sound of unsheathing sword] Finish him.

00:04:39.028 --> 00:04:41.698
- [Ronnie:] That was impressive. I gotta… we got a lot to discuss.
- [Lefkoe:] Well done, well done.

00:04:48.579 --> 00:04:51.708
- [Ronnie] You have made it very difficult for us
not to reconsider that rating.

00:04:51.708 --> 00:04:53.334
That was impressive.

00:04:53.334 --> 00:04:56.129
- Appreciate you.
- The rating is going up guaranteed.

00:04:56.254 --> 00:04:58.006
- Yeah, for sure.
- The amount that it's going up?

00:04:58.006 --> 00:05:00.800
- [Ronnie] I feel like the 70 is a no-doubter.

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:02.427
- [Laughing]

00:05:02.427 --> 00:05:03.553
- Congratulations.
- Appreciate it.

00:05:03.553 --> 00:05:06.806
- Next up we have for you, though, is rebounding.
- OK, cool.

00:05:06.806 --> 00:05:08.558
- The Worm rating.

00:05:09.892 --> 00:05:12.854
- [ImDavisss:] Karl-Anthony Towns definitely needs
his Worm badge upgraded.

00:05:12.895 --> 00:05:15.982
The Worm badge is necessary
for getting rebounds in 2K, all right,

00:05:15.982 --> 00:05:18.526
and him having it in bronze
is absolutely ridiculous.

00:05:18.776 --> 00:05:20.028
We've already seen his footwork.

00:05:20.028 --> 00:05:22.196
We already know he can make position
for himself in the paint

00:05:22.363 --> 00:05:24.240
and do everything necessary
to get the rebounds.

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:27.035
So 2K, why is his Worm badge only on bronze?

00:05:27.952 --> 00:05:31.247
- The reason we're doing this is because
you have a bronze Worm rating.

00:05:32.332 --> 00:05:34.876
So this is your opportunity
to upgrade that.

00:05:34.876 --> 00:05:36.919
- [Towns:] I had—I'm in top five in rebounding
like every year

00:05:36.919 --> 00:05:38.629
since I've been in, right?

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:42.383
- Ronnie. I know.
- [Ronnie:] I know.

00:05:44.552 --> 00:05:47.013
- [Lefkoe:] We have, uh, some obstacles for you.

00:05:47.388 --> 00:05:48.973
They're a little prehistoric.

00:05:48.973 --> 00:05:50.933
Here's how this is gonna work, Karl.

00:05:50.933 --> 00:05:53.686
We're gonna have a shooter from the top of the key.
- [Towns:] OK.

00:05:53.686 --> 00:05:55.438
- [Lefkoe:] He's gonna put up five shots.
- [Towns:] Got it.

00:05:55.438 --> 00:05:57.815
- [Lefkoe:] The ball can only hit the ground

00:05:57.815 --> 00:06:00.485
in the entire drill four times.
- OK.

00:06:01.694 --> 00:06:03.363
- If you're able to do that,

00:06:03.363 --> 00:06:06.407
bronze, silver, badgin' up.
- Yup.

00:06:06.449 --> 00:06:07.700
- [Lefkoe:] Are you ready?
- Yup.

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:08.242
- [Lefkoe:] OK.

00:06:13.206 --> 00:06:15.917
- [Ronnie:] All right, let's do this.
- [Lefkoe:] OK, first one.

00:06:21.047 --> 00:06:27.845
Ooh. Oh, gets it back.
Aah!

00:06:29.013 --> 00:06:30.515
- [Towns:] Look at him! Look what I did to him with one move.
- [Lefkoe:] Look what you did to that T-Rex.

00:06:30.515 --> 00:06:32.642
- [Towns:] One move!

00:06:32.975 --> 00:06:35.186
Ronnie, forget Worm.
That's Bruiser right there.

00:06:35.186 --> 00:06:37.271
- They extinct again.
- Come on.

00:06:37.271 --> 00:06:37.939
- You just made him extinct.

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:39.774
- They should've stayed down years ago.

00:06:41.067 --> 00:06:43.444
- Two down. Two bounces.

00:06:43.569 --> 00:06:45.279
Both very impressive.

00:06:47.824 --> 00:06:51.035
And he's ready. No bounce.
And the dunk.

00:06:51.702 --> 00:06:55.289
- I love it.
- Man, get yourself up. Come on. We got two more.

00:06:56.207 --> 00:06:57.250
Damn. Let's go.

00:06:58.376 --> 00:07:02.422
- [Lefkoe:] Fourth shot. Boxing out. Gets it.
- [Ronnie:] Oh my God! The whole team gone.

00:07:03.673 --> 00:07:06.384
- Did that—I don't think that ball hit the ground that time, did it?
- Nope.

00:07:07.093 --> 00:07:09.679
- So one shot, and you can afford one bounce.
- Two bounces. One bounce.

00:07:09.679 --> 00:07:12.640
- Ready?
- [Lefkoe:] 1, 2, gets it, no bounce.

00:07:18.146 --> 00:07:19.689
Your official thoughts?

00:07:19.689 --> 00:07:21.482
- I'm very, very impressed.

00:07:23.818 --> 00:07:25.027
- How did it feel?

00:07:25.027 --> 00:07:27.697
- Yeah, it was good. You know,
Ronnie gotta be proven wrong again.

00:07:27.697 --> 00:07:28.072
- [Ronnie laughing]

00:07:28.072 --> 00:07:31.284
- So I had to come out here and put,
tie my shoes on and then, you know,

00:07:31.784 --> 00:07:34.078
just tried to do everything.
They tried to give me a beach ball.

00:07:34.078 --> 00:07:35.037
- [Lefkoe:] Yup.
- Tried to give me a target.

00:07:35.037 --> 00:07:36.414
- Yup.
- Tried to give me another basketball

00:07:36.414 --> 00:07:37.707
- Yup.
- That was—that was some "Inception" stuff.

00:07:37.707 --> 00:07:39.959
- And then you took it up to a baseball throw.
- Yeah, right?

00:07:40.042 --> 00:07:42.295
And then, and then you gave me
some prehistoric animals.

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:44.797
- [Ronnie:] I mean, that was impressive.

00:07:44.797 --> 00:07:47.717
You can just tell over there. Undoubted—
- No-doubter?

00:07:47.717 --> 00:07:49.427
- No-doubter. He's a silver.
- Wow.

00:07:49.719 --> 00:07:53.514
- So today your passing went up 10 points.

00:07:54.098 --> 00:07:56.184
You went up a badge
in terms of the Worm.

00:07:56.517 --> 00:07:59.520
And now it's my favorite thing to do
is to put Ronnie on the spot.

00:08:00.855 --> 00:08:03.274
Is Karl-Anthony Towns underrated?

00:08:03.691 --> 00:08:06.319
- With everything I saw?
Absolutely. Absolutely underrated.

00:08:06.986 --> 00:08:09.030
My man.
- He said it!

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:10.990
That means it's real!

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:14.118
- You looked good. I'm sorry, I'm sorry.
- And that's why we do "Underrated."

00:08:14.118 --> 00:08:17.413
Karl-Anthony Towns, underrated. Congratulations.
- Appreciate you.

